Rules-Requires-Root: no

Package: super-log
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}, nodejs (>= 18), libatomic1
Description: one hub for every log stream on a development bench
 super-log converges every log stream on one machine and one screen:
 device, service, container, browser, chain and app logs, interleaved by
 arrival - not by device clocks, which drift.
 .
 This package installs the hub daemon (superlogd) as a systemd service, the
 C and C++ SDK headers, and the zero-dependency Node tailers as commands on
 PATH: superlog, superlog-fix (FIX session logs), superlog-mavlink (drone
 telemetry), superlog-otlp (an OpenTelemetry inlet) and many more.
